[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「呼……」
[np]

[r]冲个澡洗去汗水，换上睡衣前往真珠星的房间。
[np]

[supica storage="A_pajyama_L AB2_3_L"]
[playcv storage="supica_supica_00300_001.ogg" name="supica"]
[character name="supica"]
[FACEVIEW storage="supica_AB_3_FACE_pajyama"]
